<view wx:if="{{a}}" class="page"><view class="cover"><text>{{b}}</text></view><view class="panel"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{c}}</text><text class="sold">已售 {{d}}</text></view><view class="prices"><text class="group-price">¥{{e}}</text><text class="single-price">单买 ¥{{f}}</text><text class="original">原价 ¥{{g}}</text></view><text class="meta">{{h}} 人成团 · {{i}} 天有效</text></view><view wx:if="{{j}}" class="panel"><text class="section-title">正在拼团</text><view wx:for="{{k}}" wx:for-item="team" wx:key="d" class="team"><view><text class="team-name">{{team.a}} 的团</text><text class="meta">还差 {{team.b}} 人成团</text></view><button bindtap="{{team.c}}">去拼团</button></view></view><view class="panel"><text class="section-title">消费须知</text><text class="paragraph">{{l}}</text></view><view class="panel"><text class="section-title">服务保障</text><text class="paragraph">{{m}}</text></view><view class="panel"><text class="section-title">商品介绍</text><text class="paragraph">{{n}}</text></view><view class="actions"><button open-type="contact">客服</button><button class="group" bindtap="{{p}}">发起拼团 ¥{{o}}</button><button class="single" bindtap="{{r}}">单独购买 ¥{{q}}</button></view></view>